# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets — provider credentials are SERVER-SIDE ONLY and must never be
# committed. The local AI gateway reads them from the process environment
# (see docs/PHASE_6_3_3_REAL_PROVIDER.md). Values are never tracked here;
# only the variable NAMES are documented.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
